# Gestor de paquetes: pnpm obligatorio

## Regla obligatoria

En `apps/web`, `apps/server` y raíz del monorepo:

| Permitido | Prohibido |
|-----------|-----------|
| `pnpm install` | `npm install` / `npm i` / `npm ci` |
| `pnpm add` / `pnpm add -D` | `npm uninstall` / `npm update` |
| `pnpm remove` | `npm run` |
| `pnpm run <script>` | `npx` → usar `pnpm dlx` o `pnpm exec` |
| Lockfile `pnpm-lock.yaml` | `package-lock.json`, `yarn.lock`, `bun.lock*` |

## Scripts del monorepo

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm dev:server    # backend :3001
pnpm dev:web       # frontend :5174
pnpm build
pnpm lint
pnpm test
```

## Docker

Usar `pnpm` en Dockerfiles de `apps/web` y `apps/server`.

## Artefactos prohibidos

No crear ni versionar: `package-lock.json`, `yarn.lock`, `bun.lock*`.
